WEBVTT

00:13:28.903 --> 00:13:31.763
dispute is going to be
around water, energy

00:13:31.763 --> 00:13:35.222
and how you can really deal 
with not only conventional energy,

00:13:35.222 --> 00:13:39.662
but how you can really make 
a more sustainable energy for the future.

00:13:39.662 --> 00:13:44.372
And, of course, health, 
which is really a very important element,

00:13:44.372 --> 00:13:46.050
of having a healthy population.

00:13:46.419 --> 00:13:49.759
And, you know, 
because the region in general

00:13:49.759 --> 00:13:52.639
has a very high rate, when it comes 
to diabetes and cancer,

00:13:52.639 --> 00:13:59.490
so there is a big focus when it comes 
to research around diabetes and cancer

00:13:59.490 --> 00:14:04.354
and, if you would like, in neurosciences.